
  config   : config/run.yaml
  scenario : heavy_load - Worst realistic day - double production, heavier parts and a half-charged robot.
  model    : ns
  planner  : ThetaStar
  view     : headless
  shift    : 1200.0 s simulated
  seed     : 5000     dashboard: false     build: false

[run] 1/3  sourcing ROS 2 Jazzy ...
[run] 2/3  skipping build (build: false)
[run] 3/3  sourcing the workspace and launching ...

  The robot starts on the blue charger (south-west) and begins by itself after ~30 s.
  Sections: A red (north-west), B yellow (north-east), C purple (south-east);
  delivery point green (south-centre).
  Watch it:  http://localhost:8000   (read-only dashboard: model, planner, live results)
  Results:   logs/<run_id>_mission_summary.yaml when the shift ends
  Stop:      Ctrl+C here, then ./scripts/stop.sh

